def add_joint_block_review(d,P,new_page,para,table,picture):
 new_page(d,'Lower memory joint solver review')
 para(d,'26 October 2026. The V26B relieved joint still has no accepted equilibrium solution. A new method factors the tongue and fork separately to reduce stored matrix entries. The CAD, loads, contact equations and accuracy limits were kept unchanged. This is a failed solver pilot, not proof that the physical joint breaks.')
 table(d,['Pilot check','Recorded result'],[['Stored factor entries on first step','27.78 million versus 92.64 million previously'],['First linear relative error','0.00000846 against limit 0.000020'],['Residual after first Newton step','0.03843 against final target 0.0000001'],['Second linear relative error','0.001015 against limit 0.000020'],['Second step outcome','Stopped after 320 iterations and failed accuracy check'],['Accepted new stress or strength result','None']],[4.1,2.8])
 para(d,'About 70 percent fewer factor entries improved storage requirements. The second step did not meet the same accuracy gate, so it was rejected. An intermediate displacement must not be used as a valid stress result. The script, log and review JSON retain the failed attempt.')
 para(d,'SoftSpace remains an engineering concept. The earlier candidate has local motion interference; the relieved candidate passes sampled local motion but still needs a reliable strength solution and integration into a fully checked assembly. Material specific properties and tolerance effects also remain unresolved. We cannot call the headset software validated.')
 para(d,'SoftSpace Flex is unchanged by this joint test. The sourced foam loading screen remains a useful conditional comparison, but exact WH CH720N mounting dimensions, cover and recovery properties, and a calibrated acoustic seal model are still missing. The reports do not establish fit, no leakage, pain relief or sensory acceptance.')
 para(d,'Next decision: resolve the joint model with a demonstrably converged solver before treating it as a strength prediction. Obtain verified mounting dimensions and suitable material and acoustic input data before claiming a validated Sony replacement. More arbitrary material sweeps cannot close these gaps. Physical tests will still be needed after credible computer predictions.')
